# Push After Edits

After completing any requested code or content change in this repo:

1. Run `git status`, `git diff`, and `git log -1 --oneline` to review changes.
2. Stage only relevant files (never `.DS_Store` or secrets).
3. Commit with a clear message describing why the change was made.
4. Push to GitHub: `git push -u origin HEAD`

Do this automatically at the end of every edit task unless the user explicitly says not to push.

If there are no changes to commit, skip commit/push and say so briefly.

Remote: `https://github.com/ahsn3/Kizila-ac.git` (branch `main`).
